    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "영작문제 4 답안"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "다음 문제를 영작해주세요."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Why did you beat him?"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Why does he beat her?"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Why was she looking at him?"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Why does your sister look at me?"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Why is he tired?"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Why are they sad?"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "This is a very important problem, isn't this?"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I am waiting for him."
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "What is your friend waiting for?"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "You need that(the) special book, don't you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Is she writing a book?"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "What book is your husband writing?"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Did you call me last night?"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Why did you call me last night?"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Who called you last week?"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Isn't this a real interview?"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "I didn't lose my best friend."
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Why don't you feel the same?"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "We didn't see each other for a long time, did we?"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "You don't remember the night, do you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "We never talked about it, did we?"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "How old was he?"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "She misses him, doesn't she?"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "My dog ate all the bones, didn't it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "What is he doing?"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Do you remember the accident?"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Are you kidding?"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "You are kidding, aren't you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "When do you think about that night?"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "You met someone. didn't you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "He meets someone, doesn't he?"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "You don't understand."
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "My parents do not understand me."
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Your teacher does not understand you, does he (or she)?"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Did you meet her parents?"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Aren't you working this weekend?"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Is your boss working on Sunday?"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "When did we talk about this?"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Who talks about this?"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "I am a busy girl."
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "I had a sister."
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "How many sisters does your mother have?"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Do you like the color?"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "He misses her, doesn't he?"
        }
      ]
    },
